  SELECT 'listening-p1-set020-q011' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: I have already sent most of the invitations, and a colleague is organising the informal evening event. My most important task for the conference is giving a formal address. I need to welcome the delegates, introduce the main theme and explain the programme clearly. I''m preparing notes now, but I want the speech to sound natural rather than as if I am reading every word.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["257"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set020-q012' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Building manager: The doors close properly, and the main gate was repaired last month. The windows need attention. Several frames are damaged, and rainwater is entering two rooms on the upper floor. We will replace the worst windows first and repair the others where possible. Work begins on Monday, so staff should move furniture away from the outside walls before the contractors arrive. That option matched the person''s needs more closely than the alternatives.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["258"],"speaker_labels":["Building manager"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set020-q013' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Man: Sea transport remains attractive because ships can carry large at relatively low cost. However, the main influence on its future development will be the increasing use of technology. Smarter navigation, automated ports and better tracking systems should make journeys safer and more efficient. Cost will still matter, but innovation will change how ships are operated and how cargo is managed. Nothing else needed to change once the main decision had been made.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["259"],"speaker_labels":["Man"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q001' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Friend 1: Sarah said she would make the sandwiches, and Tom brought enough drinks for everyone. We brought fruit to the picnic. We chose apples, grapes and a large box of strawberries because they were easy to share and did not need cooking. After lunch, we packed the remaining pieces in a cool bag so they would stay fresh for the journey home. The choice fitted the situation better than the other ideas they had discussed.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["260"],"speaker_labels":["Friend 1"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q002' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Man: The Wi-Fi is working because my phone connects normally, and the printer completed a test page this morning. The computer is not working. It turns on for a few seconds and then shuts down before the system loads. I have checked the cable and tried another power socket. A technician is coming this afternoon, so I will use a colleague''s machine until then. It also left enough time and energy for the rest of the day.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["261"],"speaker_labels":["Man"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q003' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Announcement: The school is not closing, and the weather warning only affects outdoor sports this afternoon. The main topic is the new library hours. From next Monday, the library will open at eight in the morning and close at seven in the evening on weekdays. Saturday opening will remain unchanged. Students should check the website before visiting during holidays, as different times may apply. The alternatives remained possible on another occasion, but not this time.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["262"],"speaker_labels":["Announcement"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q004' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Teacher: Do not leave your assignment at my office, because I may not be there to record it, and main reception cannot accept coursework. Students should submit their assignments through the online portal. The system will show a confirmation message and send an email after the upload is complete. Keep that message until the work has been marked, and contact technical support immediately if the file fails to upload.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["263"],"speaker_labels":["Teacher"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q005' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Teacher: Our football practice is usually on Friday evening, but the sports field will be used for a school event this week. We cannot play on Monday morning because you have a science test. Therefore, the practice has been moved to Wednesday afternoon. Please meet outside the changing rooms at four o''clock.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["264"],"speaker_labels":["Teacher"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q006' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: I went shopping for a dress yesterday. At first, I tried on a red one, but it was too tight. The assistant then showed me a blue dress, although I did not like its style. In the end, I bought a simple black one. It fits perfectly, and I can wear it to the party next week.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["265"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q007' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: The weather was lovely during my holiday. I originally planned to spend the day at the beach, but it was extremely crowded. I also wanted to visit the local museum, although it was closed for repairs. Instead, I went to a large park near my hotel, walked around the lake and had lunch there.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["266"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q008' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Tour guide: This morning, the bus collected us outside the hotel, but it will not return there this evening. We first planned to meet at the museum entrance, although the road nearby is now closed. Please go to the marketplace instead. The bus will be waiting beside the main gate at six thirty.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["267"],"speaker_labels":["Tour guide"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q009' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: I nearly wrote half past ten in my diary because that''s when Sarah said she would be free. Then I remembered the room is booked for another group from to ten until ten o''clock. Luckily, that still gives us enough time to set everything up. The original schedule hasn''t actually changed, so everyone should be in their seats and ready to begin at past ten.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["268"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q010' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Man: The search itself has gone much better than I expected. I found a place near my office, and after speaking to the bank, it looks as though the mortgage should be manageable. The problem is at home. My wife thinks moving now would be too disruptive for the children, and my parents keep telling us to wait another year. The house is right, and the money is available. I just can''t get everyone to agree.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["269"],"speaker_labels":["Man"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q011' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Man: Hi, I''m here already. I got off the bus a few minutes ago and stopped at the bank to get some cash, so don''t wait for me at the station. I''ve crossed the square now. I''m standing outside that large old building where we went to register for the local event last month. There are some steps at the front and a clock above the entrance. I''ll wait here until you arrive.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["270"],"speaker_labels":["Man"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q012' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Customer: I expected the café to be noisy at lunchtime, but it was actually than usual, and my coffee arrived hot. I chose a table in the corner because I needed to finish some work before a meeting. That''s when the trouble started. My laptop connected without any problem, but pages took forever to open, and I couldn''t upload a document at all. In the end, I had to use my phone''s mobile data.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["271"],"speaker_labels":["Customer"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set021-q013' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: I almost didn''t go after work because that time of day is usually packed, but when I arrived there were plenty of free machines. I also checked my latest payment, and the membership still costs the same. I''d mainly gone for the yoga session, though. When I reached the studio, several people were waiting outside. One of the staff came over and explained that the instructor had become ill, so we were told there wouldn''t be a session that evening.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["272"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q001' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"I''m calling about our parent-teacher meeting. We usually have these meetings twice a year. As you''re a new parent, this will be a good chance for us to meet and talk about your son''s progress. You can also ask me any you may have. The meeting will be on Monday at 5:30 p.m. Please come to my classroom. I look forward to meeting you then.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["273"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q002' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Hello, this is Mohamed from the travel company. I''m calling to answer your about our bus card. The bus card costs $20, and this price covers the whole trip. You don''t need to pay any extra fees during the journey. If you have any other about the bus card or the trip, please feel free to contact us.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["274"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q003' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: Do you still want to meet for lunch tomorrow? Man: Definitely. I have a meeting until one, though. Woman: Shall we say two o''clock, then? Man: That''s a bit late for me. I only need about half an hour to get from the office to the restaurant. Woman: So one thirty? Man: Perfect. I''ll see you there.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["275"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q004' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"I''m going to Emma''s party on Saturday, and at first I thought I''d take some food with me. But she said she''s already ordered more than enough for everyone. I also offered to bring a speaker, but she''s got music sorted as well. What she really wants is something the whole group can use together after dinner - something fun that can keep everyone entertained for an hour or two. I''ve got a couple of those at home, so I''ll take them with me.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["276"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q005' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Just a notice for customers: the shop will be closed for maintenance at the beginning of this week. We won''t be open on Tuesday or Wednesday while the new flooring is installed. Normal opening hours will begin again on Thursday morning at nine o''clock.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["277"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q006' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: What do you think of these blue shoes? Man: They''re interesting, but the colour is unusual. Woman: Maybe the black ones would be safer. Man: They would, but they''re a bit boring, aren''t they? Woman: True. What about the pair beside them? The brighter ones? Man: Those suit you much better. They''re warm-coloured without looking too unusual. Woman: Yes, I think I''ll buy those.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["278"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q007' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Man: I''m just having coffee. It''s what I normally order here. Woman: The fish looks good today. Man: Are you hungry enough for a full meal? Woman: Not really. I think I''d rather have something sweet. Man: They''ve got chocolate cake and apple pie. Woman: I''ll have the cake, then.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["279"],"speaker_labels":["Man"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q008' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Woman: Could we meet at four thirty? Man: I can''t. I have to collect my brother from the bus station then. He''s coming back from London. Woman: Will five be okay? Man: I might still be on my way back. Woman: Let''s give you another half hour. Man: Yes, five thirty would be much safer.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["280"],"speaker_labels":["Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q009' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"I''ve decided I really need to change my morning routine. Getting up at eight means I''m always rushing and sometimes I don''t even have time for breakfast. I did think about setting my alarm for six, but there''s no chance I''d manage that every day. So I''m going to choose the time exactly between those two. That should give me enough time without making the morning unbearable.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["281"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q010' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"B"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"The new house is much bigger than our old place. There''s one room downstairs that we''re going to use for guests, and upstairs there are three more rooms where people can sleep. One of those will be ours and the other two will be for the children. It''s definitely more space than we had before.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["282"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q011' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Student: I''m really struggling with this assignment. The topic is much harder than I expected.\nTeacher: You can simplify some of the examples if that helps.\nStudent: Could I change the whole subject? Teacher: I wouldn''t recommend starting again now.\nStudent:","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["283"],"speaker_labels":["Student","Teacher"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q012' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"Interviewer: Why did you decide to take a job overseas? Was it because the salary was better? Woman: No, actually, the pay was almost exactly the same. Interviewer: Was it mainly because you wanted to experience another culture? Woman: That was interesting, but it wasn''t the main reason. My sister had been living there for several years, and before I moved we could only see each other once or twice a year. Taking the job meant we could meet much more often. Interviewer: I can see why that appealed to you.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["284"],"speaker_labels":["Interviewer"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p1-set022-q013' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"C"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"People often ask me what I like most about travelling for work. It isn''t the hotels - honestly, after a while they all feel the same - and I certainly don''t enjoy getting up at four in the morning for an early flight. The best part is talking to people from different companies. They often solve problems in ways I haven''t considered before, and I usually return to the office with completely fresh approaches that I can try in my own work.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["285"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
  SELECT 'listening-p2-set001-q001' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"A"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"**Segment 1 — Does not use commercial cleaning products**\n\nPerson A: I find the act of giving away old or secondhand items a bit hypocritical. Why do people give away their old things, only to go out and buy the same item but brand new? Not only does this fail to protect the environment, but it also causes double the harm. Personally, I have a way of protecting the environment by not releasing harmful chemicals into it. I do this by not purchasing chemical cleaning solutions. Instead, I make use of natural products like lemons to create my own floor-cleaning solutions.\n\n\n\n**Segment 2 — Does not use commercial cleaning products**\n\nPerson B: I often don''t have time to think about how to reuse my belongings or clothes, but I don''t want to throw them away because that would be wasteful. So, I think a better way is to donate them to charity organizations or give them to others. Many people are in need of these things, and giving away my old items also makes me feel happier because I''m helping others.\n\n\n\n**Segment 3 — Buy environmentally friendly products**\n\nPerson C: A good way to protect the environment is by not using plastic bags or by bringing reusable bags when going to the market, which helps reduce the disposal of plastic bags, a material that is difficult to decompose. However, I''m a very busy person and rarely have time to prepare my own bags when going shopping, and I usually drive to buy groceries quickly instead of walking. I guess I can''t protect the environment by not driving. But I have a principle of only buying eco-friendly products, so I think I’m still contributing in a small way to protecting the Earth.\n\n\n\n**Segment 4 — Reuse containers for storing food**\n\nPerson D: I see that too many people are wasting food containers, as they often throw them away after use, such as glass jars or plastic bottles. I can reuse them to store food and neatly organize them in my refrigerator. Reusing these containers is a very easy way to protect the environment that anyone can do.","transcript_status":"source_word_comments","word_comment_ids":["286","287","288","289"],"speaker_labels":["Person A","Person B","Person C","Person D"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
