use it has a useful destination, but exercising just for the sake of it feels like unpaid work. Give me a novel and a comfortable chair instead.","transcript_status":"source_word_comments","word_comment_ids":["342","343","344","345"],"speaker_labels":["Person A","Person B","Person C","Person D"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
