turn off the tap while brushing my teeth and run the dishwasher only when full. Those small routines continued long after the restrictions ended because wasting clean water no longer feels harmless.","transcript_status":"source_word_comments","word_comment_ids":["346","347","348","349"],"speaker_labels":["Person A","Person B","Person C","Person D"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
