ns or suggests a brighter colour. Some evenings I produce nothing worth keeping, and that is fine because nobody is watching. The privacy gives me room to experiment, make mistakes, and follow an idea without explaining it.","transcript_status":"source_word_comments","word_comment_ids":["350","351","352","353"],"speaker_labels":["Person A","Person B","Person C","Person D"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
