st nothing to look at. It sounds dull, but that emptiness is exactly what lets me concentrate.","transcript_status":"source_word_comments","word_comment_ids":["358","359","360","361"],"speaker_labels":["Person A","Person B","Person C","Person D"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
