  SELECT 'listening-p2-set021-q004' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"D"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"**Segment 1 — products are delivered**\n\nAfter breaking my ankle, ordinary shopping became a military operation: crutches, taxis, and someone to carry the bags upstairs. A neighbour showed me how to order groceries, and two hours later a driver placed everything beside my kitchen counter. My ankle healed months ago, but the habit remained. I still visit markets for fresh fruit, yet washing powder, bottled drinks, and other heavy items come to me. Home delivery changed online shopping from an option into my default.\n\n\n\n**Segment 2 — it is cheaper**\n\nMy brother buys the first thing he sees; I treat shopping like detective work. I leave an item in the basket, search for vouchers, compare three sites, and check whether postage cancels the saving. It paid off when I furnished my room: the lamp, chair, and shelves all cost less online than the local shop''s sale prices. The process takes patience, but finding the lowest total feels like winning a small competition.\n\n\n\n**Segment 3 — it saves time**\n\nI run a small bakery and finish after most shops have closed. Before internet shopping, Saturday morning was lost to buying packaging, cleaning supplies, and ingredients I had forgotten. Now I place orders after midnight while the ovens cool. It may not sound exciting, but getting those errands off my weekend has given me time to see friends again. The biggest benefit is not comfort or price; it is recovering hours that work used to steal.\n\n\n\n**Segment 4 — it has more choices**\n\nI collect old film posters, which is a hopeless hobby if you only search local shops. Online marketplaces connect me with sellers in tiny towns and even other countries. One week I found ten versions of the same poster, each from a different cinema release. I have to inspect photographs carefully because condition varies, but the range is extraordinary. A physical shop might offer one lucky discovery; the internet gives me an entire world of possibilities.","transcript_status":"source_word_comments","word_comment_ids":["366","367","368","369"],"speaker_labels":["Person A","Person B","Person C","Person D"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
