  SELECT 'listening-p3-set005-q001' AS sk, '{"correct_option":"woman"}'::jsonb AS correct_answer, '{"transcript":"W: You know, I really feel there''s too much information on the Internet. It can be overwhelming sometimes. It''s hard to know what''s credible.\nM: Honestly, I think it''s more about how we search for information. Finding what we need online requires certain skills. We need to know how to filter through all that content.\nW: Definitely! If you don''t know how to search properly, you can easily get lost in all that noise.\nM: And I believe the Internet affects the way we think. With so much information available, we often skim rather than think deeply about topics.\nW: That''s an interesting point. I hadn''t thought about that. But I do see how the constant scrolling and instant answers can make young people less patient.\nM: Exactly! They expect instant results. It''s like waiting for anything has become a challenge.\nW: Right! So, while the Internet offers us a wealth of knowledge, it can also reduce our patience and tolerance.","transcript_status":"source_word_comment","word_comment_ids":["465"],"speaker_labels":["Man","Woman"]}'::jsonb AS solution_data
  UNION ALL
